Subject: [PATCH] guilib: add a "blur" font style

A font with <style>blur</style> draws its glyphs blurred: three box blurs
(close to a gaussian) of each glyph, in a margin, when it is cached. The
text keeps the sharp font's layout. Skins can hide text that must not be
read yet, such as an unwatched episode's plot, and still show its shape.
System.SupportsBlurFont tells a skin that the style is there, so it can
fall back on another Kodi.

